  "text": "proprium.sancti-iacobi-apostoli-collecta",
  "about": "The collecta of the formulary “Saint James the Apostle” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Protect Your people and make them holy, O Lord, so that, guarded by the help of Your Apostle James, they may please You by their conduct and serve You with peace of mind. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end." },
    "s02": { "translation": "Amen." }
  },
